$il$17 Sept, FOURTH FUNCTION AND THIRD DAY. Generate draft now returns unauthorized too, on Frank Pelzer at Vodafone Germany, shown both as a toast and inline in the Outreach tab where the draft should be. So the list is AI edit, Regenerate, Send now and Generate draft. Every function that calls out is down and reads still work, which makes the single credential or token diagnosis as strong as it is going to get without seeing the logs.

IT ALSO CHANGES WHAT THE OUTAGE COSTS. Until now the queue could not be corrected or drained but it could still be worked, because 63 drafts already existed. With Generate draft down, no new draft can be produced at all, so a contact freshly added or freshly accepted cannot be actioned through Lovable in any way. The system is now read only in practice.

WORTH SAYING TO BRAD PLAINLY: this is not four bugs to triage, it is one thing to restore, and every day it stays down the manual workaround writes more rows that i053 and i048 will have to reconcile afterwards.$il$
